{"synopsis":"Kim Sangan adalah seorang lintah darat berdarah dingin.\nKetika adiknya yang merupakan seorang guru bunuh diri setelah disiksa bertubi-tubi oleh muridnya…\nDia menjadi wali kelas baru mereka untuk menagih “utang” nyawa adiknya.\nSeorang rentenir yang rela merangkak ke dasar neraka demi menagih utang, dan murid-murid yang tidak kalah dari iblis.\nHubungan “guru dan murid” yang brutal, dimulai.","alternative_title":"사채지간","author":"Black and White","artist":"Kim Dong Chan","chapters":[{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"9382f226-8b78-46e9-86cf-a8f08824c164","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"63aeeb18-6e79-4881-b57d-b89a0afd6348","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"7ffa1de0-7bb2-4f97-982a-c4464802fef8","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-07-19"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"2793f162-976a-45dd-988f-1e864a60ea5f","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-10"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"96dd8175-566e-4b6e-917e-d9ea27974e23","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"847323bf-1ced-4cf8-9280-dc36e248b94f","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-06-30"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"64e40606-069b-4a8d-b47c-58c0e539f49d","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-06-27"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"09d88e1b-32ff-455e-8016-5d4c8ad64da7","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-06-11"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"4faece95-f248-4747-8535-c8dd73a85b6c","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-11"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"c0ae9d41-c186-4f5e-b1b2-614253643f87","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-01"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"56342ee3-1fa7-40b1-a929-c571c319dc3c","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-05-29"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"f18b1162-e34f-4a4f-a334-d8bd45a12b21","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-05-15"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"268b47c5-e37a-4566-9494-3731670c89a6","title"